  <body dur="03:39.390">
    <div begin="00:13.390" end="03:39.390">
      <p begin="00:13.390" end="00:15.330" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L1"><span begin="00:13.390" end="00:14.070">笑</span><span begin="00:14.070" end="00:14.730">う</span><span begin="00:14.730" end="00:15.050">な</span><span begin="00:15.050" end="00:15.330">ら</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">若要欢笑</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">若要歡笑</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">If you're going to smile</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">웃을 거라면</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Si tu veux sourire</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Si vas a sonreír</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Wenn du lachen willst</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Se for para sorrir</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Если смеяться</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Se devi sorridere</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Warau nara</span></p>
      <p begin="00:15.720" end="00:18.660" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L2"><span begin="00:15.720" end="00:16.370">描</span><span begin="00:16.370" end="00:16.730">く</span><span begin="00:16.730" end="00:17.380">な</span><span begin="00:17.380" end="00:17.730">ら</span><span begin="00:17.730" end="00:18.420">今</span><span begin="00:18.420" end="00:18.660">だ</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">若要描绘 就是此刻</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">若要描繪 就是此刻</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">If you're going to draw it now is the time</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">그려 낼 거라면 지금이야</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Si tu veux dessiner c’est maintenant</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Si vas a dibujar que sea ahora</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Wenn du etwas zeichnen willst dann jetzt</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Se for para desenhar é agora</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Если рисовать то сейчас</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Se devi dipingere fallo adesso</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Egaku nara ima da</span></p>
      <p begin="00:19.020" end="00:23.700" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L3"><span begin="00:19.020" end="00:19.750">言</span><span begin="00:19.750" end="00:20.060">葉</span><span begin="00:20.060" end="00:20.400">な</span><span begin="00:20.400" end="00:20.720">ん</span><span begin="00:20.720" end="00:21.050">か</span><span begin="00:21.050" end="00:21.230">じ</span><span begin="00:21.230" end="00:21.410">ゃ</span><span begin="00:21.710" end="00:22.390">伝</span><span begin="00:22.390" end="00:22.740">わ</span><span begin="00:22.740" end="00:23.090">ら</span><span begin="00:23.090" end="00:23.400">な</span><span begin="00:23.400" end="00:23.700">い</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">言语早已无法传达</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">言語早已無法傳達</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">Words could never make it understood</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">말 따위로는 전할 수 없어</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Les mots ne suffiront jamais à le transmettre</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Con palabras jamás podría expresarse</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Mit Worten allein lässt es sich nicht vermitteln</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Palavras jamais conseguiriam transmitir isso</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Одними словами этого не передать</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Con le parole non si può trasmettere</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Kotoba nanka ja tsutawaranai</span></p>
      <p begin="00:24.040" end="00:27.690" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L4"><span begin="00:24.040" end="00:24.750">空</span><span begin="00:24.750" end="00:25.060">に</span><span begin="00:25.380" end="00:26.040">放</span><span begin="00:26.040" end="00:26.420">つ</span><span begin="00:26.690" end="00:27.080">ラ</span><span begin="00:27.080" end="00:27.410">イ</span><span begin="00:27.410" end="00:27.690">ン</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">向天空抛掷的轨迹</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">向天空拋擲的軌跡</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">A line cast into the sky</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">하늘로 던져 올린 선</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Une ligne lancée vers le ciel</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Una línea lanzada al cielo</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Eine Linie die ich in den Himmel werfe</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Uma linha lançada ao céu</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Линия брошенная в небо</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Una linea lanciata nel cielo</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Sora ni hanatsu rain</span></p>
      <p begin="00:28.020" end="00:30.400" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L5"><span begin="00:28.020" end="00:28.740">狂</span><span begin="00:28.740" end="00:29.080">い</span><span begin="00:29.080" end="00:29.410">合</span><span begin="00:29.410" end="00:29.760">う</span><span begin="00:29.760" end="00:30.400">愛</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">相互纠缠的愛</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">相互糾纏的愛</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">A love that drove us both mad</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">서로 미쳐 가던 사랑</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Un amour qui sombre avec nous dans la folie</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Un amor que enloquece al encontrarse</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Eine Liebe die uns beide wahnsinnig machte</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Um amor em que enlouquecemos juntos</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Любовь сводившая нас с ума</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Un amore che ci fa impazzire insieme</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Kuruiau ai</span></p>
      <p begin="00:30.740" end="00:34.410" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L6"><span begin="00:30.740" end="00:31.040">間</span><span begin="00:31.040" end="00:31.800">違</span><span begin="00:31.800" end="00:32.040">い</span><span begin="00:32.040" end="00:32.420">さ</span><span begin="00:32.420" end="00:32.710">え</span><span begin="00:32.710" end="00:33.800">貫</span><span begin="00:33.800" end="00:34.070">い</span><span begin="00:34.070" end="00:34.410">た</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">连错误都贯彻到底</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">連錯誤都貫徹到底</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">We followed through even with our mistakes</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">잘못마저 끝까지 관철했어</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">J’ai poursuivi jusqu’au bout même dans l’erreur</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Seguimos adelante incluso aferrados a nuestros errores</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Selbst unsere Fehler zogen wir bis zum Ende durch</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Levamos até os nossos erros até o fim</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Мы шли до конца даже в своих ошибках</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Abbiamo portato fino in fondo persino i nostri errori</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Machigai sae tsuranuita</span></p>
      <p begin="00:34.740" end="00:39.710" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L7"><span begin="00:34.740" end="00:35.370">道</span><span begin="00:35.370" end="00:36.070">し</span><span begin="00:36.070" end="00:36.410">る</span><span begin="00:36.410" end="00:36.740">べ</span><span begin="00:36.740" end="00:37.080">は</span><span begin="00:37.410" end="00:37.710">こ</span><span begin="00:37.710" end="00:38.070">こ</span><span begin="00:38.070" end="00:38.420">だ</span><span begin="00:38.420" end="00:38.730">っ</span><span begin="00:38.730" end="00:39.070">た</span><span begin="00:39.070" end="00:39.380">の</span><span begin="00:39.380" end="00:39.710">か</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">路标竟在此处吗</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">路標竟在此處嗎</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">Was this where the signpost had been all along</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">길잡이는 바로 여기였던 걸까</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">C’était donc ici notre point de repère</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">¿Así que aquí estaba la señal del camino?</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">War also genau hier unser Wegweiser?</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Então era aqui que estava o nosso caminho</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Так вот где был наш путеводный знак</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Era davvero qui la nostra guida</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Michishirube wa koko datta no ka</span></p>
      <p begin="00:40.030" end="00:45.070" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L8"><span begin="00:40.030" end="00:40.740">全</span><span begin="00:40.740" end="00:41.410">て</span><span begin="00:41.410" end="00:42.030">は</span><span begin="00:42.030" end="00:42.740">君</span><span begin="00:42.740" end="00:43.080">が</span><span begin="00:43.410" end="00:44.050">学</span><span begin="00:44.050" end="00:44.400">ぶ</span><span begin="00:44.400" end="00:44.740">の</span><span begin="00:44.740" end="00:45.070">だ</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">一切皆由你领悟</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">一切皆由你領悟</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">You are the one who must learn it all</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">모든 것은 네가 스스로 깨닫게 될 거야</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">C’est à toi d’apprendre tout cela</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Todo tendrás que aprenderlo tú</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Alles musst du selbst begreifen</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">É você quem há de aprender tudo</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Всему этому тебе предстоит научиться</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Tutto questo dovrai impararlo tu</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Subete wa kimi ga manabu no da</span></p>
      <p begin="00:46.040" end="00:48.080" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L9"><span begin="00:46.040" end="00:46.760">No</span><span begin="00:46.760" end="00:46.960">ti</span><span begin="00:46.960" end="00:47.100">ce</span> <span begin="00:47.100" end="00:47.750">no</span><span begin="00:47.750" end="00:48.000">ti</span><span begin="00:48.000" end="00:48.080">ce</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">察觉吧 察觉吧</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">察覺吧 察覺吧</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ja">気づいて 気づいて</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">깨달아 깨달아</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Prends conscience prends conscience</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Date cuenta date cuenta</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Merk es merk es</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Perceba perceba</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Заметь заметь</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Accorgiti accorgiti</span></p>
      <p begin="00:48.390" end="00:51.330" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L10"><span begin="00:48.390" end="00:48.690">愛</span><span begin="00:48.690" end="00:48.880">し</span><span begin="00:48.880" end="00:49.050">い</span><span begin="00:49.050" end="00:49.410">か</span><span begin="00:49.410" end="00:49.690">な</span><span begin="00:49.690" end="00:49.740">？</span><span begin="00:49.740" end="00:50.410">別</span><span begin="00:50.410" end="00:50.750">れ</span><span begin="00:50.750" end="00:51.330">は</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">可曾怜惜？离别时</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">可曾憐惜？離別時</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">Could parting ever be something dear?</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">이별마저 사랑스러운 걸까</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Cette séparation serait-elle donc si chère ?</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">¿Acaso es entrañable la despedida?</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Ist der Abschied wirklich so liebenswert?</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Será que até a despedida pode ser querida</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Неужели даже разлука может быть дорога сердцу?</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">È forse così caro l'addio?</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Itoshii kana? Wakare wa</span></p>
      <p begin="00:51.330" end="00:54.740" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L11"><span begin="00:51.330" end="00:51.740">散</span><span begin="00:51.740" end="00:52.060">る</span><span begin="00:52.060" end="00:52.370">タ</span><span begin="00:52.370" end="00:52.720">バ</span><span begin="00:52.720" end="00:53.080">コ</span><span begin="00:53.080" end="00:53.400">の</span><span begin="00:53.400" end="00:53.710">明</span><span begin="00:53.710" end="00:54.070">か</span><span begin="00:54.070" end="00:54.410">り</span><span begin="00:54.410" end="00:54.740">が</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">烟蒂明灭的火光</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">菸蒂明滅的火光</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">The fading glow of a cigarette</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">스러져 가는 담뱃불이</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">La lueur mourante de la cigarette</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">La luz del cigarrillo que se extinguía</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Das verglimmende Licht der Zigarette</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">A luz do cigarro se desfazendo</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Угасающий огонёк сигареты</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Il bagliore disperso della sigaretta</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Chiru tabako no akari ga</span></p>
      <p begin="00:55.040" end="00:56.710" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L12"><span begin="00:55.040" end="00:55.400">サ</span><span begin="00:55.400" end="00:55.640">イ</span><span begin="00:55.640" end="00:55.720">ン</span><span begin="00:55.720" end="00:55.950">だ</span><span begin="00:55.950" end="00:56.070">っ</span><span begin="00:56.070" end="00:56.310">た</span><span begin="00:56.310" end="00:56.400">ん</span><span begin="00:56.400" end="00:56.710">だ</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">便是告别的讯号</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">便是告別的訊號</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">Had been the sign</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">그 신호였던 거야</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">C’était le signe</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Era la señal</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">War unser Zeichen</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Era o sinal</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Был тем самым знаком</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Era quello il segnale</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Sain dattan da</span></p>
      <p begin="00:56.710" end="00:58.760" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L13"><span begin="00:56.710" end="00:57.400">For</span><span begin="00:57.400" end="00:57.720">get</span> <span begin="00:57.720" end="00:58.420">for</span><span begin="00:58.420" end="00:58.760">get</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">忘却吧 忘却吧</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">忘卻吧 忘卻吧</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ja">忘れて 忘れて</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">잊어 잊어</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Oublie oublie</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Olvida olvida</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Vergiss es vergiss es</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Esqueça esqueça</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Забудь забудь</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Dimentica dimentica</span></p>
      <p begin="00:59.060" end="01:00.960" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L14"><span begin="00:59.060" end="00:59.400">忘</span><span begin="00:59.400" end="00:59.720">れ</span><span begin="00:59.720" end="01:00.070">ら</span><span begin="01:00.070" end="01:00.400">れ</span><span begin="01:00.400" end="01:00.740">な</span><span begin="01:00.740" end="01:00.960">い</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">偏偏难以忘怀</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">偏偏難以忘懷</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">I can't forget</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">잊을 수가 없어</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Impossible d’oublier</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">No puedo olvidarlo</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Ich kann es nicht vergessen</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Eu não consigo esquecer</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Но я не могу забыть</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Non riesco a dimenticare</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Wasure rarenai</span></p>
      <p begin="01:01.370" end="01:05.680" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L15"><span begin="01:01.370" end="01:01.730">す</span><span begin="01:01.730" end="01:02.030">れ</span><span begin="01:02.030" end="01:02.740">違</span><span begin="01:02.740" end="01:03.030">う</span><span begin="01:03.030" end="01:03.360">視</span><span begin="01:03.360" end="01:04.080">線</span><span begin="01:04.080" end="01:04.360">は</span><span begin="01:04.360" end="01:04.740">知</span><span begin="01:04.740" end="01:05.270">ら</span><span begin="01:05.270" end="01:05.420">な</span><span begin="01:05.420" end="01:05.680">い</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">装作不识交错的目光</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">裝作不識交錯的目光</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">I know nothing of those glances passing by</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">스쳐 가는 시선은 아무것도 몰라</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Nos regards qui se croisent ne savent rien</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Las miradas que se cruzan no saben nada</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Unsere Blicke die sich kreuzen tun so als wüssten sie von nichts</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Nada sei dos olhares que se cruzam</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Наши разминувшиеся взгляды ничего не знают</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Gli sguardi che si incrociano senza conoscersi</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Surechigau shisen wa shiranai</span></p>
      <p begin="01:05.930" end="01:08.190" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L16"><span begin="01:05.930" end="01:06.030">気</span><span begin="01:06.030" end="01:06.380">づ</span><span begin="01:06.380" end="01:06.740">け</span><span begin="01:06.740" end="01:07.050">な</span><span begin="01:07.050" end="01:07.380">い</span><span begin="01:07.380" end="01:08.080">か</span><span begin="01:08.080" end="01:08.190">ら</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">因我尚未察觉</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">因我尚未察覺</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">Because I never notice</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">알아차릴 수 없으니까</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Puisque nous ne pouvons nous en apercevoir</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Porque no logran darse cuenta</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Weil ich es nicht bemerken kann</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Porque ainda não consigo perceber</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Потому что я не могу заметить</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Perché non riesco ad accorgermene</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Kizukenai kara</span></p>
      <p begin="01:17.390" end="01:19.290" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L17"><span begin="01:17.390" end="01:18.030">隠</span><span begin="01:18.030" end="01:18.720">し</span><span begin="01:18.720" end="01:19.070">て</span><span begin="01:19.070" end="01:19.290">も</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">纵然隐藏</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">縱然隱藏</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">Even if I hide it</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">숨겨 봐도</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Même si je le cache</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Aunque lo esconda</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Selbst wenn ich es verberge</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Mesmo que eu esconda</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Даже если скрывать</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Anche se lo nascondo</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Kakushite mo</span></p>
      <p begin="01:19.710" end="01:22.640" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L18"><span begin="01:19.710" end="01:20.360">壊</span><span begin="01:20.360" end="01:20.740">し</span><span begin="01:20.740" end="01:21.410">て</span><span begin="01:21.410" end="01:21.740">も</span><span begin="01:21.740" end="01:22.410">未</span><span begin="01:22.410" end="01:22.640">だ</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">纵然破坏 依然</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">縱然破壞 依然</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">Even if I break it still</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">부숴 봐도 아직</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Même si je le brise ça demeure encore</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Aunque lo destruya todavía</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Selbst wenn ich es zerstöre bleibt es noch immer</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Mesmo que eu destrua ainda assim</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Даже если разрушать всё ещё</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Anche se lo distruggo ancora</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Kowashite mo imada</span></p>
      <p begin="01:23.030" end="01:27.650" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L19"><span begin="01:23.030" end="01:23.740">言</span><span begin="01:23.740" end="01:24.080">葉</span><span begin="01:24.080" end="01:24.450">な</span><span begin="01:24.450" end="01:24.700">ん</span><span begin="01:24.700" end="01:25.060">か</span><span begin="01:25.060" end="01:25.190">じ</span><span begin="01:25.190" end="01:25.320">ゃ</span><span begin="01:25.750" end="01:26.070">言</span><span begin="01:26.070" end="01:26.390">い</span><span begin="01:26.390" end="01:26.740">切</span><span begin="01:26.740" end="01:27.070">れ</span><span begin="01:27.070" end="01:27.420">な</span><span begin="01:27.420" end="01:27.650">い</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">言语无法说尽</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">言語無法說盡</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">Words could never say it all</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">말 따위로는 다 표현할 수 없어</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Les mots ne suffiront jamais à tout dire</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Las palabras no bastan para decirlo todo</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Mit Worten allein lässt sich niemals alles sagen</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Palavras jamais seriam suficientes para dizer tudo</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Одними словами всего не выразить</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Le parole non bastano a dire tutto</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Kotoba nanka ja iikirenai</span></p>
      <p begin="01:28.070" end="01:34.360" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L20"><span begin="01:28.070" end="01:28.750">肌</span><span begin="01:28.750" end="01:29.010">を</span><span begin="01:29.400" end="01:29.740">交</span><span begin="01:29.740" end="01:30.020">わ</span><span begin="01:30.020" end="01:30.290">す</span><span begin="01:30.740" end="01:31.380">夕</span><span begin="01:31.380" end="01:31.680">日</span><span begin="01:32.080" end="01:32.410">の</span><span begin="01:32.410" end="01:33.040">並</span><span begin="01:33.040" end="01:33.420">木</span><span begin="01:33.420" end="01:34.080">道</span><span begin="01:34.080" end="01:34.360">を</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">肌肤相触的夕阳林荫道</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">肌膚相觸的夕陽林蔭道</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">Along the tree-lined road where the sunset brushed our skin</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">서로의 살결을 스치던 노을 진 가로수길을</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Sur l’allée bordée d’arbres au couchant où nos peaux se frôlaient</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Por la avenida al atardecer donde nuestras pieles se rozaron</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Die Allee im Abendrot wo unsere Haut sich berührte</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Pela alameda ao pôr do sol onde nossas peles se tocaram</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">По аллее в закате где мы касались друг друга</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Lungo il viale al tramonto dove le nostre pelli si sfioravano</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Hada o kawasu yuuhi no namikimichi o</span></p>
      <p begin="01:34.740" end="01:38.390" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L21"><span begin="01:34.740" end="01:35.410">何</span><span begin="01:35.410" end="01:35.640">も</span><span begin="01:35.640" end="01:36.070">言</span><span begin="01:36.070" end="01:36.370">わ</span><span begin="01:36.370" end="01:36.740">ず</span><span begin="01:36.740" end="01:37.790">貫</span><span begin="01:37.790" end="01:38.070">い</span><span begin="01:38.070" end="01:38.390">た</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">沉默着贯穿始终</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">沉默著貫穿始終</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">We carried on without a word</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">아무 말 없이 끝까지 걸어갔어</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">J’ai continué jusqu’au bout sans rien dire</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Seguimos adelante sin decir una palabra</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Durchquerten wir ohne ein einziges Wort</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Seguimos até o fim sem dizer nada</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Мы прошли до конца не сказав ни слова</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Abbiamo continuato senza dire nulla</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Nani mo iwazu tsuranuita</span></p>
      <p begin="01:38.740" end="01:43.720" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L22"><span begin="01:38.740" end="01:39.400">遠</span><span begin="01:39.400" end="01:40.060">く</span><span begin="01:40.060" end="01:40.410">に</span><span begin="01:40.410" end="01:40.760">い</span><span begin="01:40.760" end="01:41.050">る</span><span begin="01:41.400" end="01:41.720">あ</span><span begin="01:41.720" end="01:42.060">な</span><span begin="01:42.060" end="01:42.720">た</span><span begin="01:42.720" end="01:43.060">だ</span><span begin="01:43.060" end="01:43.410">け</span><span begin="01:43.410" end="01:43.720">が</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">唯有远方的你</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">唯有遠方的你</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">Only you so far away</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">멀리 있는 너만이</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Toi qui es loin</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Solo tú que estás tan lejos</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Nur du dort in der Ferne</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Só você tão distante</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Лишь ты оставшийся вдали</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Soltanto tu che sei così lontano</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Tooku ni iru anata dake ga</span></p>
      <p begin="01:44.000" end="01:49.020" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L23"><span begin="01:44.000" end="01:44.750">全</span><span begin="01:44.750" end="01:45.410">て</span><span begin="01:45.410" end="01:46.100">の</span><span begin="01:46.100" end="01:46.410">意</span><span begin="01:46.410" end="01:46.740">味</span><span begin="01:46.740" end="01:47.080">を</span><span begin="01:47.400" end="01:48.060">抱</span><span begin="01:48.060" end="01:48.420">く</span><span begin="01:48.420" end="01:48.730">の</span><span begin="01:48.730" end="01:49.020">だ</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">承载全部意义</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">承載全部意義</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">Hold the meaning of it all</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">모든 의미를 품고 있는 거야</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Tu portes en toi tout le sens de tout cela</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Guardas dentro todo su significado</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Trägst die Bedeutung von allem in dir</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Carrega consigo o sentido de tudo</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Хранишь в себе смысл всего</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Custodisci il significato di ogni cosa</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Subete no imi o idaku no da</span></p>
      <p begin="01:50.080" end="01:52.070" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L24"><span begin="01:50.080" end="01:50.430">I</span> <span begin="01:50.430" end="01:50.770">be</span><span begin="01:50.770" end="01:51.080">lieve</span> <span begin="01:51.080" end="01:51.430">I</span> <span begin="01:51.430" end="01:51.770">be</span><span begin="01:51.770" end="01:52.070">lieve</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我坚信 我坚信</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">我堅信 我堅信</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ja">信じてる 信じてる</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">믿어 믿고 있어</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">J’y crois j’y crois</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Creo creo</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Ich glaube ich glaube</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Eu acredito eu acredito</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Я верю я верю</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Ci credo ci credo</span></p>
      <p begin="01:52.390" end="01:55.030" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L25"><span begin="01:52.390" end="01:52.740">何</span><span begin="01:52.740" end="01:53.040">も</span><span begin="01:53.040" end="01:53.420">か</span><span begin="01:53.420" end="01:53.730">も</span><span begin="01:53.730" end="01:54.370">許</span><span begin="01:54.370" end="01:54.740">し</span><span begin="01:54.740" end="01:55.030">て</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">原谅所有一切</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">原諒所有一切</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">Forgiving everything</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">모든 것을 용서하고</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Pardonne tout</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Perdónalo todo</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Vergib einfach alles</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Perdoe tudo</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Прости мне всё</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Perdona ogni cosa</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Nani mo kamo yurushite</span></p>
      <p begin="01:55.370" end="01:58.650" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L26"><span begin="01:55.370" end="01:55.750">あ</span><span begin="01:55.750" end="01:56.060">な</span><span begin="01:56.060" end="01:56.380">た</span><span begin="01:56.380" end="01:56.710">だ</span><span begin="01:56.710" end="01:57.040">け</span><span begin="01:57.040" end="01:57.390">を</span><span begin="01:57.390" end="01:58.050">感</span><span begin="01:58.050" end="01:58.380">じ</span><span begin="01:58.380" end="01:58.650">て</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">只因感知到你存在</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">只因感知到你存在</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">Feeling only you</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">오직 너만을 느끼며</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Je n’ai ressenti que toi</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Sintiendo solo tu presencia</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Ich habe nur dich gespürt</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Sentindo apenas você</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Я чувствовала лишь тебя</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Ho sentito soltanto te</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Anata dake o kanjite</span></p>
      <p begin="01:59.070" end="02:00.690" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L27"><span begin="01:59.070" end="01:59.390">生</span><span begin="01:59.390" end="01:59.740">き</span><span begin="01:59.740" end="01:59.960">て</span><span begin="01:59.960" end="02:00.060">き</span><span begin="02:00.060" end="02:00.240">た</span><span begin="02:00.240" end="02:00.390">ん</span><span begin="02:00.390" end="02:00.690">だ</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">才活到如今</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">才活到如今</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">That's how I've lived all this time</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">살아왔던 거야</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">C’est ainsi que j’ai vécu</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Así he vivido hasta hoy</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Und so mein Leben gelebt</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Foi assim que vivi até hoje</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">И так жила всё это время</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Ed è così che ho vissuto</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Ikite kitan da</span></p>
      <p begin="02:00.690" end="02:02.720" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L28"><span begin="02:00.690" end="02:01.410">For</span><span begin="02:01.410" end="02:01.700">get</span> <span begin="02:01.700" end="02:02.410">for</span><span begin="02:02.410" end="02:02.720">get</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">忘却吧 忘却吧</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">忘卻吧 忘卻吧</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ja">忘れて 忘れて</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">잊어 잊어</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Oublie oublie</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Olvida olvida</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Vergiss es vergiss es</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Esqueça esqueça</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Забудь забудь</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Dimentica dimentica</span></p>
      <p begin="02:03.030" end="02:05.050" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L29"><span begin="02:03.030" end="02:03.400">全</span><span begin="02:03.400" end="02:03.740">部</span><span begin="02:03.740" end="02:04.390">嘘</span><span begin="02:04.390" end="02:04.750">だ</span><span begin="02:04.750" end="02:05.050">よ</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">尽是谎言啊</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">盡是謊言啊</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">It was all a lie</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">전부 거짓말이야</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Tout ça n’est que mensonge</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Todo es mentira</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Das alles ist gelogen</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Tudo isso é mentira</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Всё это ложь</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">È tutta una bugia</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Zenbu uso da yo</span></p>
      <p begin="02:05.360" end="02:09.610" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L30"><span begin="02:05.360" end="02:05.740">す</span><span begin="02:05.740" end="02:06.040">れ</span><span begin="02:06.040" end="02:06.750">違</span><span begin="02:06.750" end="02:07.010">う</span><span begin="02:07.010" end="02:07.360">視</span><span begin="02:07.360" end="02:08.080">線</span><span begin="02:08.080" end="02:08.380">は</span><span begin="02:08.380" end="02:08.660">消</span><span begin="02:08.660" end="02:09.240">せ</span><span begin="02:09.240" end="02:09.420">な</span><span begin="02:09.420" end="02:09.610">い</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">交错的目光无法抹去</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">交錯的目光無法抹去</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">I can't erase those glances passing by</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">스쳐 가는 시선은 지울 수 없어</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Je ne peux effacer ces regards qui se croisent</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">No puedo borrar las miradas que se cruzan</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Die Blicke die sich kreuzen kann ich nicht auslöschen</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Não consigo apagar os olhares que se cruzam</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Но наши разминувшиеся взгляды мне не стереть</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Non posso cancellare gli sguardi che si incrociano</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Surechigau shisen wa kesenai</span></p>
      <p begin="02:09.890" end="02:11.970" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L31"><span begin="02:09.890" end="02:10.410">認</span><span begin="02:10.410" end="02:10.760">め</span><span begin="02:10.760" end="02:11.080">な</span><span begin="02:11.080" end="02:11.370">い</span><span begin="02:11.370" end="02:11.770">か</span><span begin="02:11.770" end="02:11.970">ら</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">因我不愿承认</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">因我不願承認</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">Because I refuse to admit it</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">인정하지 않으니까</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Parce que je refuse de l’admettre</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Porque me niego a aceptarlo</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Weil ich es nicht anerkennen will</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Porque me recuso a admitir</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Потому что я не хочу этого признавать</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Perché mi rifiuto di ammetterlo</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Mitomenai kara</span></p>
      <p begin="02:24.050" end="02:29.660" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L32"><span begin="02:24.050" end="02:24.390">閉</span><span begin="02:24.390" end="02:24.710">ざ</span><span begin="02:24.710" end="02:25.390">し</span><span begin="02:25.390" end="02:25.760">た</span><span begin="02:25.760" end="02:26.060">意</span><span begin="02:26.060" end="02:26.410">味</span><span begin="02:26.730" end="02:27.010">を</span><span begin="02:27.010" end="02:27.700">探</span><span begin="02:27.700" end="02:28.080">し</span><span begin="02:28.080" end="02:28.410">合</span><span begin="02:28.410" end="02:28.750">う</span><span begin="02:28.750" end="02:29.110">よ</span><span begin="02:29.110" end="02:29.460">う</span><span begin="02:29.460" end="02:29.660">に</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">如同寻找封闭的意义</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">如同尋找封閉的意義</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">As though searching together for the meaning we sealed away</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">닫혀 버린 의미를 서로 찾아 헤매듯</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Comme si nous cherchions ensemble le sens que nous avions enfermé</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Como si buscáramos juntos el significado que encerramos</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Als würden wir gemeinsam nach der verschlossenen Bedeutung suchen</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Como se procurássemos juntos o sentido que encerramos</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Будто вместе ищем смысл того что было заперто</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Come se cercassimo insieme un significato ormai sigillato</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Tozashita imi o sagashiau you ni</span></p>
      <p begin="02:30.080" end="02:34.990" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L33"><span begin="02:30.080" end="02:30.410">お</span><span begin="02:30.410" end="02:31.100">互</span><span begin="02:31.100" end="02:31.410">い</span><span begin="02:31.410" end="02:31.740">の</span><span begin="02:31.740" end="02:32.420">今</span><span begin="02:32.420" end="02:32.720">を</span><span begin="02:32.720" end="02:33.030">気</span><span begin="02:33.030" end="02:33.380">づ</span><span begin="02:33.380" end="02:33.760">か</span><span begin="02:33.760" end="02:34.060">ぬ</span><span begin="02:34.060" end="02:34.420">よ</span><span begin="02:34.420" end="02:34.760">う</span><span begin="02:34.760" end="02:34.990">に</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">如同忽略彼此的当下</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">如同忽略彼此的當下</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">As though neither of us should notice who we are now</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">서로의 지금을 알아차리지 못하도록</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Pour ne pas voir le présent l’un de l’autre</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Como si evitáramos darnos cuenta del presente del otro</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Als wollten wir beide das Heute des anderen nicht bemerken</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Como se não percebêssemos o presente um do outro</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Будто стараемся не замечать чем каждый из нас живёт сейчас</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Come per non accorgerci del presente l'uno dell'altra</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Otagai no ima o kizukanu you ni</span></p>
      <p begin="02:35.390" end="02:39.700" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L34"><span begin="02:35.390" end="02:35.730">あ</span><span begin="02:35.730" end="02:36.070">な</span><span begin="02:36.070" end="02:36.400">た</span><span begin="02:36.400" end="02:36.740">だ</span><span begin="02:36.740" end="02:37.080">け</span><span begin="02:37.080" end="02:37.420">は</span><span begin="02:37.420" end="02:37.740">わ</span><span begin="02:37.740" end="02:38.070">か</span><span begin="02:38.070" end="02:38.390">ら</span><span begin="02:38.390" end="02:38.740">ぬ</span><span begin="02:38.740" end="02:39.070">よ</span><span begin="02:39.070" end="02:39.410">う</span><span begin="02:39.410" end="02:39.700">に</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">唯独不能让你知晓</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">唯獨不能讓你知曉</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">So that you alone will never understand</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">너만큼은 알지 못하도록</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Pour que toi au moins tu ne comprennes pas</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Como si solo tú nunca llegaras a saberlo</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Damit ausgerechnet du es niemals verstehst</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Como se só você jamais pudesse entender</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Чтобы только ты ничего не понял</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Come se soltanto tu non dovessi capirlo</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Anata dake wa wakaranu you ni</span></p>
      <p begin="02:40.000" end="02:45.030" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L35"><span begin="02:40.000" end="02:40.750">全</span><span begin="02:40.750" end="02:41.390">て</span><span begin="02:41.390" end="02:41.670">が</span><span begin="02:42.000" end="02:42.730">君</span><span begin="02:42.730" end="02:42.980">を</span><span begin="02:43.350" end="02:44.010">殺</span><span begin="02:44.010" end="02:44.380">す</span><span begin="02:44.380" end="02:44.780">か</span><span begin="02:44.780" end="02:45.030">ら</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">因万物都将扼杀你</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">因萬物都將扼殺你</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">Because everything will destroy you</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">모든 것이 너를 죽여 버릴 테니까</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Parce que tout finira par te tuer</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Porque todo terminará destruyéndote</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Denn all das wird dich zugrunde richten</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Porque tudo acabará matando você</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Потому что всё это убьёт тебя</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Perché ogni cosa finirà per ucciderti</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Subete ga kimi o korosu kara</span></p>
      <p begin="02:46.060" end="02:48.060" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L36"><span begin="02:46.060" end="02:46.740">No</span><span begin="02:46.740" end="02:46.940">ti</span><span begin="02:46.940" end="02:47.100">ce</span> <span begin="02:47.100" end="02:47.730">no</span><span begin="02:47.730" end="02:47.970">ti</span><span begin="02:47.970" end="02:48.060">ce</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">察觉吧 察觉吧</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">察覺吧 察覺吧</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ja">気づいて 気づいて</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">깨달아 깨달아</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Prends conscience prends conscience</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Date cuenta date cuenta</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Merk es merk es</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Perceba perceba</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Заметь заметь</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Accorgiti accorgiti</span></p>
      <p begin="02:48.370" end="02:51.020" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L37"><span begin="02:48.370" end="02:48.700">愛</span><span begin="02:48.700" end="02:48.870">し</span><span begin="02:48.870" end="02:49.040">い</span><span begin="02:49.040" end="02:49.400">か</span><span begin="02:49.400" end="02:49.670">な</span><span begin="02:49.670" end="02:49.720">？</span><span begin="02:49.720" end="02:50.410">別</span><span begin="02:50.410" end="02:50.710">れ</span><span begin="02:50.710" end="02:51.020">は</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">可曾怜惜？离别时</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">可曾憐惜？離別時</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">Could parting ever be something dear?</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">이별마저 사랑스러운 걸까</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Cette séparation serait-elle donc si chère ?</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">¿Acaso es entrañable la despedida?</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Ist der Abschied wirklich so liebenswert?</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Será que até a despedida pode ser querida</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Неужели даже разлука может быть дорога сердцу?</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">È forse così caro l'addio?</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Itoshii kana? Wakare wa</span></p>
      <p begin="02:51.340" end="02:54.690" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L38"><span begin="02:51.340" end="02:52.070">崩</span><span begin="02:52.070" end="02:52.360">れ</span><span begin="02:52.360" end="02:52.730">合</span><span begin="02:52.730" end="02:53.060">う</span><span begin="02:53.060" end="02:53.380">言</span><span begin="02:53.380" end="02:53.700">い</span><span begin="02:53.700" end="02:54.410">訳</span><span begin="02:54.410" end="02:54.690">で</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">相互崩塌的借口</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">相互崩塌的藉口</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">Our crumbling excuses</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">서로 무너져 내리는 변명 속에</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Avec des excuses qui s’effondrent les unes sur les autres</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Entre excusas que se derrumban unas sobre otras</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Zwischen all den Ausreden die ineinander zerfallen</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Entre desculpas que desmoronam umas sobre as outras</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Наши рушащиеся оправдания</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Tra scuse che crollano l'una sull'altra</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Kuzureau iiwake de</span></p>
      <p begin="02:55.060" end="02:56.690" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L39"><span begin="02:55.060" end="02:55.390">混</span><span begin="02:55.390" end="02:55.600">ざ</span><span begin="02:55.600" end="02:55.730">っ</span><span begin="02:55.730" end="02:55.950">て</span><span begin="02:55.950" end="02:56.070">い</span><span begin="02:56.070" end="02:56.230">く</span><span begin="02:56.230" end="02:56.400">ん</span><span begin="02:56.400" end="02:56.690">だ</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">渐渐交融一体</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">漸漸交融一體</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">Keep blending into one another</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">뒤섞여 가는 거야</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Tout finit par se mêler</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Todo acaba mezclándose</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Vermischt sich alles miteinander</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Tudo vai se misturando</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Смешиваются друг с другом</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Tutto finisce per confondersi</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Mazatte ikun da</span></p>
      <p begin="02:56.720" end="02:58.730" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L40"><span begin="02:56.720" end="02:57.420">For</span><span begin="02:57.420" end="02:57.720">get</span> <span begin="02:57.720" end="02:58.420">for</span><span begin="02:58.420" end="02:58.730">get</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">忘却吧 忘却吧</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">忘卻吧 忘卻吧</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ja">忘れて 忘れて</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">잊어 잊어</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Oublie oublie</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Olvida olvida</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Vergiss es vergiss es</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Esqueça esqueça</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Забудь забудь</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Dimentica dimentica</span></p>
      <p begin="02:59.060" end="03:00.990" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L41"><span begin="02:59.060" end="02:59.420">忘</span><span begin="02:59.420" end="02:59.730">れ</span><span begin="02:59.730" end="03:00.030">て</span><span begin="03:00.030" end="03:00.410">し</span><span begin="03:00.410" end="03:00.760">ま</span><span begin="03:00.760" end="03:00.990">え</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">全都遗忘吧</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">全都遺忘吧</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">Just forget it all</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">전부 잊어 버려</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Oublie tout</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Olvídalo todo</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Vergiss es einfach</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Esqueça tudo de uma vez</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Забудь же всё</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Dimentica tutto</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Wasurete shimae</span></p>
      <p begin="03:01.370" end="03:06.350" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L42"><span begin="03:01.370" end="03:01.720">す</span><span begin="03:01.720" end="03:02.010">れ</span><span begin="03:02.010" end="03:02.740">違</span><span begin="03:02.740" end="03:03.030">う</span><span begin="03:03.030" end="03:03.360">視</span><span begin="03:03.360" end="03:04.080">線</span><span begin="03:04.080" end="03:04.300">は</span><span begin="03:04.300" end="03:04.750">知</span><span begin="03:04.750" end="03:05.060">ら</span><span begin="03:05.060" end="03:05.400">な</span><span begin="03:05.400" end="03:05.710">い</span><span begin="03:05.710" end="03:06.070">か</span><span begin="03:06.070" end="03:06.350">ら</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">既然不识交错的目光</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">既然不識交錯的目光</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">Because I know nothing of those glances passing by</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">스쳐 가는 시선은 아무것도 모르니까</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Parce que nos regards qui se croisent ne savent rien</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Porque las miradas que se cruzan no saben nada</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Denn unsere Blicke die sich kreuzen wissen von nichts</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Porque nada sabemos dos olhares que se cruzam</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Ведь наши разминувшиеся взгляды ничего не знают</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Perché gli sguardi che si incrociano non sanno nulla</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Surechigau shisen wa shiranai kara</span></p>
      <p begin="03:06.740" end="03:09.340" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L43"><span begin="03:06.740" end="03:07.060">ホ</span><span begin="03:07.060" end="03:07.390">オ</span><span begin="03:07.390" end="03:07.620">ズ</span><span begin="03:07.620" end="03:07.750">キ</span><span begin="03:07.750" end="03:07.900">の</span><span begin="03:07.900" end="03:08.420">花</span><span begin="03:08.420" end="03:08.590">が</span><span begin="03:08.590" end="03:08.780">咲</span><span begin="03:08.780" end="03:08.940">い</span><span begin="03:08.940" end="03:09.100">た</span><span begin="03:09.100" end="03:09.340">ら</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">若酸浆花盛开之时</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">若酸漿花盛開之時</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">When the winter cherry blooms</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">꽈리꽃이 피어나면</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Quand fleuriront les physalis</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Cuando florezcan los farolillos japoneses</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Wenn die Lampionblumen blühen</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Quando as flores de physalis desabrocharem</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Когда зацветёт физалис</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Quando sbocceranno i fiori dell'alchechengi</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Hoozuki no hana ga saitara</span></p>
      <p begin="03:09.700" end="03:12.200" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L44"><span begin="03:09.700" end="03:10.060">君</span><span begin="03:10.060" end="03:10.260">を</span><span begin="03:10.260" end="03:10.400">連</span><span begin="03:10.400" end="03:10.610">れ</span><span begin="03:10.610" end="03:10.740">て</span><span begin="03:10.740" end="03:11.080">街</span><span begin="03:11.080" end="03:11.260">の</span><span begin="03:11.260" end="03:11.590">風</span><span begin="03:11.590" end="03:11.750">に</span><span begin="03:11.750" end="03:11.980">な</span><span begin="03:11.980" end="03:12.090">ろ</span><span begin="03:12.090" end="03:12.200">う</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">便带你化作街巷的风</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">便帶你化作街巷的風</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">I'll take you with me and become the wind through the city</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">너를 데리고 거리의 바람이 되자</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Je t’emmènerai et nous deviendrons le vent de la ville</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Te llevaré conmigo y nos volveremos el viento de la ciudad</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Nehme ich dich mit und wir werden zum Wind der Stadt</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Vou levar você comigo e nos tornaremos o vento da cidade</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Я уведу тебя с собой и мы станем ветром этого города</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Ti porterò con me e diventeremo il vento della città</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Kimi o tsurete machi no kaze ni narou</span></p>
      <p begin="03:12.390" end="03:14.710" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L45"><span begin="03:12.390" end="03:12.610">あ</span><span begin="03:12.610" end="03:12.740">の</span><span begin="03:12.740" end="03:12.960">日</span><span begin="03:12.960" end="03:13.080">の</span><span begin="03:13.080" end="03:13.250">意</span><span begin="03:13.250" end="03:13.410">味</span><span begin="03:13.410" end="03:13.640">も</span><span begin="03:13.640" end="03:13.750">ま</span><span begin="03:13.750" end="03:13.930">や</span><span begin="03:13.930" end="03:14.240">か</span><span begin="03:14.240" end="03:14.410">し</span><span begin="03:14.410" end="03:14.710">も</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">那日的意义与虚妄</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">那日的意義與虛妄</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">The meaning of that day and every illusion</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">그날의 의미도 거짓된 환상도</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Le sens de ce jour-là comme ses illusions</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">El significado de aquel día y también sus engaños</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Die Bedeutung jenes Tages und all seine Täuschungen</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">O significado daquele dia e todas as ilusões</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">И смысл того дня и все иллюзии</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Il significato di quel giorno e ogni illusione</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Ano hi no imi mo mayakashi mo</span></p>
      <p begin="03:14.710" end="03:17.360" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L46"><span begin="03:14.710" end="03:15.060">全</span><span begin="03:15.060" end="03:15.240">部</span><span begin="03:15.240" end="03:15.740">忘</span><span begin="03:15.740" end="03:16.080">れ</span><span begin="03:16.080" end="03:16.240">な</span><span begin="03:16.240" end="03:16.390">い</span><span begin="03:16.390" end="03:16.740">よ</span><span begin="03:16.740" end="03:17.090">う</span><span begin="03:17.090" end="03:17.360">に</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">只为全部铭记</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">只為全部銘記</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">So that I never forget any of it</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">모두 잊지 않도록</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Pour ne rien oublier de tout cela</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Para no olvidar nada de ello</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Damit wir nichts davon jemals vergessen</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Para que eu jamais me esqueça de nada</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Чтобы ничего из этого не забыть</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Per non dimenticare nulla</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Zenbu wasurenai you ni</span></p>
      <p begin="03:17.730" end="03:20.080" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L47"><span begin="03:17.730" end="03:18.080">君</span><span begin="03:18.080" end="03:18.300">と</span><span begin="03:18.300" end="03:18.640">笑</span><span begin="03:18.640" end="03:18.750">う</span><span begin="03:18.750" end="03:19.090">夏</span><span begin="03:19.090" end="03:19.290">の</span><span begin="03:19.290" end="03:19.610">日</span><span begin="03:19.610" end="03:19.750">々</span><span begin="03:19.750" end="03:20.080">を</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">与你欢笑的夏日时光</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">與你歡笑的夏日時光</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">Those summer days when I laughed with you</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">너와 함께 웃던 여름날들을</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Ces jours d’été où je riais avec toi</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Los días de verano en que reí contigo</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">An die Sommertage an denen ich mit dir lachte</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Dos dias de verão em que sorrimos juntos</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Те летние дни когда мы смеялись вместе</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Quei giorni d'estate in cui ridevo con te</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Kimi to warau natsu no hibi o</span></p>
      <p begin="03:20.390" end="03:24.070" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L48"><span begin="03:20.390" end="03:20.700">何</span><span begin="03:20.700" end="03:21.070">十</span><span begin="03:21.070" end="03:21.410">年</span><span begin="03:21.410" end="03:21.660">だ</span><span begin="03:21.660" end="03:21.720">っ</span><span begin="03:21.720" end="03:21.930">て</span><span begin="03:21.930" end="03:22.260">思</span><span begin="03:22.260" end="03:22.400">い</span><span begin="03:22.400" end="03:22.690">出</span><span begin="03:22.690" end="03:22.900">す</span><span begin="03:22.900" end="03:23.060">ん</span><span begin="03:23.060" end="03:23.270">だ</span><span begin="03:23.270" end="03:24.070">よ</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">纵过数十年仍将忆起</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">縱過數十年仍將憶起</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">I'll remember them even decades from now</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">몇십 년이 지나도 다시 떠올릴 거야</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Même dans des dizaines d’années je m’en souviendrai</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Los recordaré aunque pasen décadas</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Werde ich mich selbst nach Jahrzehnten noch erinnern</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Mesmo depois de décadas ainda vou me lembrar</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Я буду вспоминать их даже спустя десятки лет</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Li ricorderò anche tra decine d'anni</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Nanjuunen datte omoidasun da yo</span></p>
      <p begin="03:25.650" end="03:31.600" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L49"><span begin="03:25.650" end="03:26.050">真</span><span begin="03:26.050" end="03:26.750">実</span><span begin="03:26.750" end="03:27.080">を</span><span begin="03:27.080" end="03:27.400">ま</span><span begin="03:27.400" end="03:27.720">や</span><span begin="03:27.720" end="03:28.030">か</span><span begin="03:28.030" end="03:28.740">し</span><span begin="03:28.740" end="03:31.600">て</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">因若继续欺瞒真实</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">因若繼續欺瞞真實</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">Disguising the truth as illusion</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">진실을 거짓으로 덧칠하고</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">En travestissant la vérité</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Disfrazando la verdad con engaños</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Ich verschleiere die Wahrheit</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Disfarçando a verdade com ilusões</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Искажая правду иллюзией</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Continuando a mascherare la verità</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Shinjitsu o mayakashite</span></p>
      <p begin="03:32.350" end="03:39.390" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L50"><span begin="03:32.350" end="03:32.710">気</span><span begin="03:32.710" end="03:33.090">づ</span><span begin="03:33.090" end="03:33.410">い</span><span begin="03:33.410" end="03:33.690">て</span><span begin="03:33.690" end="03:34.070">し</span><span begin="03:34.070" end="03:35.690">ま</span><span begin="03:35.690" end="03:36.060">う</span><span begin="03:36.060" end="03:36.430">か</span><span begin="03:36.430" end="03:39.390">ら</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">终将被你察觉</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">終將被你察覺</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="en">Because I know I'll realize it in the end</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">결국 알아차리고 말 테니까</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Parce que je finirai malgré moi par m’en rendre compte</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Porque acabaré dándome cuenta</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Weil ich sie sonst doch erkennen würde</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Porque no fim acabarei percebendo</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Потому что иначе я всё пойму</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Perché finirei comunque per accorgermene</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Kizuite shimau kara</span></p>
    </div>
  </body>
</tt>
